# Shared Ports UI — mandatory for every page

Follow repo-root **`AGENTS.md`** (shared Ports UI section) on every page create/edit.

Import from `@/components/ports`. Do not invent a new table, search, filter, button, input, dialog, or pagination.

**Use:**

- `ListPageShell` + `useListQuery` for list pages
- `DataTable` instead of raw `<table>`
- `Filter` (one Filters button → all filters in a dialog) / `SearchBar` / `Dropdown` (always searchable) for search and filters
- Prefer `ListPageShell` which already embeds `Filter` — do not invent a new filter bar
- `InputField` / `TextAreaField` / `PasswordField` / `Dropdown` / `MultiSelectField` / `PortButton` for forms
- `FormDialog` + `FormDialogFooter` for add/edit modals
- `RowActions` for edit/delete
- `StatusChip`, `EmptyState`, `ErrorBanner`, `PageHeader`, `SectionPanel`

Do **not** ship dashboard pages with custom table markup or one-off filter bars.
